WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.775 --> 00:00:17.821
and Joy hurried home from school and parked their bikes by the front porch.

2
00:00:17.841 --> 00:00:21.143
"Grandpa!" they called.

3
00:00:21.163 --> 00:00:25.825
"I'm here in the backyard," they heard him shout.

4
00:00:25.845 --> 00:00:30.868
"Come on, Katie," said Joy, and they ran toward the backyard.

5
00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:35.370
Grandpa was building a coop with a fence around it.

6
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.971
A pile of lumber lay on the ground.

7
00:00:39.132 --> 00:00:43.294
Joy opened the gate to the coop, and all six chickens ran out.

8
00:00:43.314 --> 00:00:44.855
"Hi, chickens!"

9
00:00:45.335 --> 00:00:45.855
she said.

10
00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:48.957
"Guess what, Grandpa!"

11
00:00:49.417 --> 00:00:50.058
said Katie.

12
00:00:50.078 --> 00:00:53.800
"It's tornado season, and we have to prepare!"

13
00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.222
"Good idea," said Grandpa.

14
00:00:57.242 --> 00:01:01.204
"I'm captain of the team," said Katie.

15
00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:04.550
Grandpa raised his eyebrows.

16
00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:05.851
"The team?"

17
00:01:05.871 --> 00:01:10.394
"The Donovan Tornado Safety Team," said Katie.

18
00:01:10.414 --> 00:01:12.616
"We're having a meeting tonight.

19
00:01:13.057 --> 00:01:14.858
Hey! I better get ready."

20
00:01:18.561 --> 00:01:22.524
Joy was still hanging around the chicken coop when Dad came home from work.

21
00:01:22.544 --> 00:01:24.846
"Hi, guys.

22
00:01:25.327 --> 00:01:26.468
Nice chicken coop!"

23
00:01:26.948 --> 00:01:27.588
Dad said.

24
00:01:27.608 --> 00:01:29.870
"What's Katie so busy doing in the house?"

25
00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.720
"Hi, Dad," said Joy.

26
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:35.941
"Oh, Katie is busy being team captain."

27
00:01:37.161 --> 00:01:39.422
She poked her toe around the pile of wood.

28
00:01:39.982 --> 00:01:42.503
"What are you going to do with this extra wood, Grandpa?"

29
00:01:42.523 --> 00:01:48.104
"I don't know," said Grandpa, scratching his chin.

30
00:01:48.124 --> 00:01:51.245
"Well," said Dad.

31
00:01:51.265 --> 00:01:54.606
"If I were eight years old, I know what I'd do.

32
00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:56.307
I'd build a tree house."

33
00:01:56.327 --> 00:01:58.427
"A tree house?"

34
00:01:59.027 --> 00:01:59.668
said Joy.

35
00:01:59.688 --> 00:02:02.800
"Hmm She looked at her father.

36
00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.961
"Do you think I could build a tree house?"

37
00:02:07.762 --> 00:02:09.662
"Well, sure," said Dad.

38
00:02:10.122 --> 00:02:11.463
"With a little help you could."

39
00:02:11.483 --> 00:02:14.664
"So we could be a team?"

40
00:02:15.224 --> 00:02:15.824
asked Joy.

41
00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:20.765
"You'll need some sturdy boards for the floor," said Grandpa.

42
00:02:20.785 --> 00:02:25.987
"I could get some tin for the roof at the recycling center," added Dad.

43
00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:29.608
Joy threw her arms around Dad.

44
00:02:30.232 --> 00:02:31.813
"This is going to be fun!"

45
00:02:32.233 --> 00:02:32.733
she said.

46
00:02:32.753 --> 00:02:36.075
"I'm going to draw a picture of our tree house.

47
00:02:37.036 --> 00:02:38.637
I can already imagine it!"

48
00:02:40.998 --> 00:02:43.999
After dinner Joy worked on her drawing in the living room.

49
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.781
Grandpa sat across from her and studied his garden plan.

50
00:02:47.801 --> 00:02:52.364
"They say to watch the new oak leaves in the spring," he said.

51
00:02:52.384 --> 00:02:56.866
"When they get as big as a squirrel's ear, it's time to plant corn.

52
00:02:57.466 --> 00:03:00.068
Have you been watering your watermelon seeds, Joy?"

53
00:03:01.096 --> 00:03:04.197
"Of course, Grandpa," Joy answered, smiling.

54
00:03:05.678 --> 00:03:07.459
Then Katie marched into the room.

55
00:03:07.479 --> 00:03:09.219
"Let's start the meeting!"

56
00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:14.221
She wore a baseball cap with the word "CAPTAIN" written on the front.

57
00:03:17.723 --> 00:03:19.423
"Tornado season is here!"

58
00:03:19.964 --> 00:03:20.604
she announced.

59
00:03:20.624 --> 00:03:24.886
"The Donovan Tornado Safety Team must get ready!"

60
00:03:25.426 --> 00:03:26.987
She looked down at her notebook.

61
00:03:27.007 --> 00:03:30.408
"First, let's pick our shelter.

62
00:03:30.952 --> 00:03:33.273
It should be someplace below the ground."

63
00:03:34.534 --> 00:03:37.275
"I guess we should use the cellar," said Grandpa.

64
00:03:37.696 --> 00:03:38.996
"Just like we always have."

65
00:03:39.016 --> 00:03:42.038
"Good thinking," said Katie.

66
00:03:42.058 --> 00:03:43.379
"That was easy!

67
00:03:43.859 --> 00:03:47.141
Next, we need a radio and a flashlight."

68
00:03:48.822 --> 00:03:51.083
"I'll take care of those," offered Dad.

69
00:03:51.103 --> 00:03:55.325
"We also need a first aid kit," said Katie.

70
00:03:55.345 --> 00:03:57.806
"Mom, would you help with that?"

71
00:03:57.826 --> 00:03:59.767
"Aye, Captain."

72
00:04:01.664 --> 00:04:03.725
"Mom," groaned Katie.

73
00:04:03.745 --> 00:04:09.186
"Sorry, I couldn't resist," Mom said, laughing.

74
00:04:09.206 --> 00:04:14.688
"We'll also need some blankets and pillows," explained Katie.

75
00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:18.509
"I'll be in charge of them too," said Mom.

76
00:04:18.529 --> 00:04:23.310
"And Joy, we'll need bottled water and snacks."

77
00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:25.610
Joy jumped up.

78
00:04:26.111 --> 00:04:27.331
"Okay, I'll do it now.

79
00:04:28.151 --> 00:04:28.911
Come on, Dad.

80
00:04:29.311 --> 00:04:32.460
It's time to plan our tree house!"

81
00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.221
"Wait a minute," said Katie.

82
00:04:34.241 --> 00:04:36.422
"This meeting is not over."

83
00:04:37.982 --> 00:04:40.263
Joy sat back down, rolling her eyes.

84
00:04:40.764 --> 00:04:42.544
Katie was being bossy again.

85
00:04:42.564 --> 00:04:44.585
"A tree house?"

86
00:04:45.125 --> 00:04:45.826
thought Katie.

87
00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:49.107
She put her hand on her forehead and closed her eyes.

88
00:04:49.127 --> 00:04:52.228
"I'm getting a brilliant idea."

89
00:04:52.788 --> 00:04:54.049
Her eyes flew open.

90
00:04:54.069 --> 00:04:57.450
"Yes!" she shouted.

91
00:04:57.470 --> 00:05:02.216
"The Donovan Tornado Safety Team needs a tree house!

92
00:05:02.236 --> 00:05:04.297
It will be a weather lookout station!"

93
00:05:04.797 --> 00:05:05.978
She turned to her sister.

94
00:05:05.998 --> 00:05:07.058
"Build it!"

95
00:05:08.119 --> 00:05:09.960
Joy gave Katie a quick salute.

96
00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.581
"Aye, Captain!"

97
00:05:12.121 --> 00:05:13.101
she said, laughing.

98
00:05:14.182 --> 00:05:15.943
Katie might be bossy at times.

99
00:05:16.443 --> 00:05:17.904
But she could be funny too!
